<div class="workflow" aria-label="Investigation workflow">
  <div class="workflow-step"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Scope</h3><p>Define the production symptom, business impact and evidence boundary.</p></div>
  <div class="workflow-step"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Collect</h3><p>Client-run read-only evidence: workload, plans, locks, indexes and relevant settings.</p></div>
  <div class="workflow-step"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Investigate</h3><p>Correlate signals and distinguish the symptom from likely root cause.</p></div>
  <div class="workflow-step"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Prioritize</h3><p>Rank findings by impact, confidence, risk and implementation effort.</p></div>
  <div class="workflow-step"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Validate</h3><p>Define rollback and before/after checks so the team knows whether the change worked.</p></div>
</div>
